TANK ZERO v1.1 update 
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45297219/089f30b5f4999f411259e149f2c29fb7cbef35b9.jpg
Changes: 
*Added pause menu; 
*Improved VERSUS MODE (about them below). 
*Improved control on gamepads; 

VERSUS MODE changes: 
*Increased reward for killing enemy tanks by 2 times; 
*More money is now given for killing heavy tanks instead of the same amount as for light tanks; 
*Players passively receive 5$ every second; 
*Bonuses are spawning in the arena; 

Fixes: 
*Fixed tank reset when exiting to the menu via ESC; 
*Fixed black infinite screen of all players in multiplayer when a mission fails; 
